          "caption": "IKEA PAX TO BESPOKE BUILT IN’S\n\nI am so happy with how it’s looking!!! They really look built in!\n\nDetails of everything I’ve bought listed below! \n\nNext part adding coving, panelling the doors, painting, building an island and it will be finished!!! Can’t wait to show you the finished room!\n\nFOLLOW ALONG FOR PART 3 ❤️\n\nDetails - \nWardrobes are the IKEA PAX in natural oak. To create your design they have a free pax room planner on the Ikea website! \n\nFloor is called luiella natural oak from  @bandq_uk \n\n6x2 timber for the frame from b&q\n\nMDF sheets for the panels from b&q \n\nThe wooden drawers are from Ikea called RAST\n\nLove Jade xxx\n\n#builtinwardrobes #ikeapax #ikeapaxhack #paxhack #fittedwardrobes",
